@startuml
title State diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel class

[*] --> Idle : Open

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Account Created" as AccountCreated
state "Video Watching" as VideoWatching
state "Uploading Videos" as UploadingVideos
state "Likes List" as LikesList
state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption

Idle --> AccountCreated : Create Account
AccountCreated --> VideoWatching : Login to watch videos
VideoWatching --> Idle : Finish watching video
VideoWatching --> LikesList : Save video in likes list

UploadingVideos --> VideoWatching : Upload video and view it
LikesList --> VideoWatching : View saved videos from likes list

VideoWatching --> DiscussionOption : Enter discussion option

DiscussionOption --> VideoWatching : Continue watching video after discussion

@enduml
